title: "The backfill/live seam — double delivery is safe (SPEC §2, §4)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as chain
    participant W as watcher

    W->>C: subscribe WS (BEFORE backfill — no gap possible)

    rect rgb(235, 244, 255)
        Note over W: backfill phase
        W->>C: eth_getLogs [from .. head]
        C-->>W: event e (block b) — via backfill
        Note over W: apply e
        C-->>W: event e (block b) — via WS, queued
